data: {"id": "116be82b23b54677-thinking-parallel_evidence-875", "run_id": "116be82b23b54677", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 调查证据报告\n\n## 实体确认\n- **Pod**: `workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr`\n- **Namespace**: `aiops-case-08`\n- **UID**: `cfa13c1e-da2a-4e37-8baa-ec4be4c24c35`\n\n## 现状判定\nPod **当前处于异常状态，未恢复**。\n\n## 支持\"CrashLoopBackOff 原因为 OOMKilled\"的证据\n\n| 证据项 | 事实 |\n|--------|------|\n| **kubectl_describe** | Last State: `terminated`, Reason: `OOMKilled`, Exit Code: `137` |\n| **kubectl_get_yaml (containerStatuses)** | reason: `CrashLoopBackOff`, exitCode: `137`, restarts: `26`, message: `back-off 5m0s restarting failed container=app` |", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788806444180, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

